    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A well-presented and versatile 3/4 bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned in a mature and established residential location just off the Dublin Road. No. 6 Bellview Heights is within easy walking distance of Mullingar town centre and a host of local amenities, including Aldi, Bellview Medical Centre and St Colman?s National School.\n\nOffering flexible accommodation over two floors, together with a detached garage incorporating a home office, this property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, families or those looking to downsize.\n\nAccommodation\n\nGround Floor\n\nKitchen/Dining Room\nA bright and practical kitchen/dining space with access to the sunroom, providing an excellent area for everyday family living and entertaining.\n\nSunroom\nA useful additional living space overlooking the rear garden and providing direct access to the outdoor area.\n\nUtility Room\nConvenient separate utility area with space for laundry and storage.\n\nSitting Room\nA comfortable reception room featuring with Fireplace creating a warm and inviting focal point.\n\nBathroom\nGround-floor bathroom facilities.\n\nPlayroom / Bedroom / Home Office\nA particularly versatile room which could be used as a children's playroom, fourth bedroom, home office or additional living space, depending on the purchaser's requirements.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 1\nA well-proportioned double bedroom.\n\nBedroom 2\nA further good-sized bedroom.\n\nBedroom 3\nA third bedroom suitable for family, guest or office use.\n\nFamily Bathroom\nMain bathroom serving the first-floor bedrooms.\n\nOutside\n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a private, non-overlooked garden, a particularly attractive feature of the home. There is a composite decking area, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing.\n\nThe property also benefits from a detached garage, part of which has been converted into a home office. This provides valuable additional workspace and storage away from the main house. This represents a great opportunity for a variety of purchasers to acquire a quality home in a great neighbourhood. Viewing is highly recommended.\n"
      },
      {
